action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P24 on GtkBackend on macOS (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4): push the navigation stack and check that state outside the stack survives.
# Measured 2026-10-16 from p24-macos-gtk4-final-20261016-014116.png (1440x1176 = 720x588 pt; 2x halved; origin=frame with the 28 pt title bar), which shows Level 1 with its Back bar: Push level 2 (353,417), Record a push (360,459), Increment counter (92,175), Pop to root (226,175).
# The AppKit file's Record a push at y 440 landed just above the button (frame y 442-475) on GTK's taller layout, so pushes read 0 (gtk4-aim-20261016.csv2).
# Root-level Push level 1 (336,390) is measured from the 1 s full-screen capture p24-macos-gtk4-1s-20261016-014101.png (3840x2160 px for 1920x1080 pt; window frame at (600,214)).
# Record a push at level 2 is DERIVED, not measured: P24Level is the same view at every level and its widest line has the same width at levels 1 and 2, so the level-1 position is used.
# After this file the capture must read Level 1, pushes recorded -> 1, counter -> 2.
# GTK 版 P24:Record a push 在 frame y 442-475,改點 (360,459);第 2 層的 Record 位置是推算的(與第 1 層同一個 view)。
click,92,175,frame,left,,,Increment counter -> 1; re-centred from (84;169),macos
sleep,,,,,,600000,,macos
click,92,175,frame,left,,,-> 2,macos
sleep,,,,,,600000,,macos
click,336,390,frame,left,,,Push level 1 (the root's link) -- measured on the 1 s capture; was (330;392),macos
sleep,,,,,,1500000,,macos
click,353,417,frame,left,,,Push level 2 (a pushed level's link) -- was (352;411),macos
sleep,,,,,,1500000,,macos
click,360,459,frame,left,,,Record a push at level 2 -- pushes recorded 0 -> 1; was (359;440) above the button; DERIVED from level 1,macos
sleep,,,,,,600000,,macos
click,226,175,frame,left,,,Pop to root -- the header does not move with the stack; Level 0 and pushes back to 0 (the app resets it),macos
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,macos
click,336,390,frame,left,,,Push level 1 again,macos
sleep,,,,,,1500000,,macos
click,360,459,frame,left,,,"Record a push at level 1 -- y 440 -> 459 (button centre); the capture must read Level 1, pushes recorded -> 1, counter -> 2",macos
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,macos
